        "description": "Abnormal pulmonary function tests consistent with restrictive lung disease",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "radiographic-findings",
        "description": "Chest imaging showing nodular or fibrotic changes",
