        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Documented beryllium exposure plus positive BeLPT and either granulomatous inflammation on biopsy or consistent radiographic and pulmonary function abnormalities",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires exclusion of other granulomatous lung diseases such as sarcoidosis."
